[statement]
A provided name whose one candidate depends on a real name is decided
before that real name, and so before provided names reached earlier: `w`'s
one candidate `kw` needs the real `dep`, and `kw` is installed before `v` is
decided; it provides `v`, so `gk` is not installed. Contrast
`a-sole-candidate-without-a-real-dependency-waits`.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:v w

P:kw
V:1
p:v w=1
D:dep

P:dep
V:1

P:gk
V:1
p:v
k:100


[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install dep 1
install kw 1
install app 1
